All physical, biological, informational, and cognitive systems undergo cycles of loss and restoration. Let $C_k$ denote the magnitude of structural, energetic, or informational collapse at cycle $k$, and let $R_k$ denote the corresponding repair, regeneration, or negentropic contribution.

